2002-10-17 00:13  jbrown

	* crypto/wvblowfish.cc, crypto/wvrsa.cc, crypto/wvxor.cc,
	  include/wvbase64.h, include/wvblowfish.h, include/wvencoder.h,
	  include/wvencoderstream.h, include/wvfunctorencoder.h,
